  "content": "\n\n<h1>制作这个汉化包的初衷？</h1>\n<h2>我为什么要制作这个汉化包？</h2>\n<p>众所周知，尽管史诗战斗自带中文，但这些中文很明显已经落后现版本很多很多&hellip;</p>\n<p>所以我就想制作一个能实时跟进史诗战斗更新的汉化包。</p>\n<p>众所周知，Epic Fight（史诗战斗）自带的本地化并不完整。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_5f1679c9-25ca-4207-a167-9f7c20683959.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>完整的汉化</h1>\n<p>从简单的物品名称到详细的技能描述，所有内容都已汉化。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_cc078542-84f6-4d81-8041-d1ffaaecf2a6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_49bb6a2c-05a3-4b0d-b6d9-1fbdc3db01ac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>相关附属模组的汉化也会跟进！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_9ff752c4-70df-447b-917f-2e1438b3683e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_8d1f422b-8f98-4447-a5e9-9566d5b02dfb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>当然，数据包编辑器也有的☝️</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_bb5b3c7e-bd12-4256-8e1f-b13603e44f72.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1154256/description_b8fbb7f2-b183-48c1-bebe-ae9d2d90ad36.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<h1>如何安装？</h1>\n<p>该汉化包本质上属于材质包，按照材质包的安装方式操作即可。</p>\n<h1>已汉化的模组：</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇迹武器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">刺剑附属</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG-HUD</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warriors-of-past-epoch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">往昔战士</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/celestisynth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天神剑技</a></p>\n<h1>最后祝大家玩得愉快！</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
